node_modules
dist
.DS_Store
*.local
.env
.env.*
# ...except a checked-in template with no real values in it — same
# .env* bug found and fixed in evomedia-dashboard's Prompt 4.
!.env*.example
# ...and .env.production: Vite bakes VITE_* vars into the public client
# bundle at build time regardless, and these three (Supabase URL,
# publishable/anon key, a page's own site_id) are the exact values
# Supabase's own docs treat as safe to ship client-side — RLS, not
# secrecy, is the real security boundary (see evomedia-cms's own RLS
# policies). Committing this is what lets Vercel's git-triggered build
# produce a working bundle with no separate dashboard env-var step.
!.env.production

# Raw photo dumps — curated/optimized copies live in public/images/
/images
